Subject: [lojban-beginners] the ".i" after "lu"

=20

Along the course "Lojban For Beginners" I saw sentences with the direct
quotation word being followed by the sentence terminator ".i", like
this:=20
la ranjit cu cusku lu .i mi djica lo bakni cidjrkari .e lo sluni nanba
li'u=20
On the other hand, there are also sentences without ".i" after "lu":=20
la ranjit. pu cusku lu la djiotis. pu rinsa mi li'u=20
What is the difference between them?=20


